OL,3,GOrkney
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening and night with passing
OL,7,Fshowers but some spells of drier
OL,8,Fweather too. Drier over Shetland late.
OL,9,FFresh east to northeasterly winds and
OL,10,Fturning colder again. Minimum
OL,11,FTemperature 5C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FSome bright or sunny intervals
OL,14,Fand passing showers, showers becoming
OL,15,Fquite frequent for Shetland. Becoming
OL,16,Fdrier through the evening. Cold
OL,17,Fnortheasterly winds, strong at first.
OL,18,FMaximum Temperature 6C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
