OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry with some brightness on Tuesday.
OL,7,FCloudy on Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,8,Frain at times, gradually becoming
OL,9,Fmilder.
